<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/66/msa@/~cl_5__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/66/msa@/~cl_5> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/66/msa@> .
